  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "On Tian Ti mountain, Poison Count Lu Xu laughs at Guan Cao Ze and asks why Myriad Dragon Dock sent him to contest Hu Immortal blessed land, when Vicious Lightning Fiend of that dock had just ended closed cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        700
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_tian_ti",
        "fac_myriad_dragon_dock",
        "loc_hu_immortal_blessed_land"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan addresses the blue charm lightning shadow as Myriad Dragon Dock’s Vicious Lightning Fiend. Tai Bai Yun Sheng introduces him as a rank six Gu Immortal who has passed two heavenly tribulations, once drew with a rank seven Gu Immortal, and then entered years of closed cultivation with no traces in Central Continent.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "puppet-and-remnant-recipe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_tai_bai_yun_sheng",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "reg_central_continent"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The puppet is an immortal killer move he perfected after capturing the blue charm lightning shadow on Tian Ti mountain. Under pressure he trades a seventy percent Blood Deity remnant recipe, a secret only a small number of Myriad Dragon Dock Gu Immortals know he holds. He has a fierce, ruthless, and fiery personality.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "puppet-and-remnant-recipe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "rcp_blood_deity_immortal_gu_recipe"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Fang Yuan’s previous life he attained rank seven and had incredible battle strength. During the five regions chaotic war he used lightning deity to accumulate eight rank six battle strength beings similar to the blue charm lightning shadow. After Feng Jiu Ge died, he contested for first among rank seven in battle strength, fought Immortal Monkey King Shi Lei for three days and three nights, and lost.",
      "chapters": [
        706
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "prior-life-memory",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_feng_jiu_ge",
        "char_shi_lei"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend comprehends the immortal killer move lightning deity from a Blood Deity remnant recipe after several years of closed cultivation.",
      "chapters": [
        736
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "killer-move-from-a-remnant-recipe",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He is still only a rank six Gu Immortal, but by relying on three lightning deities he challenges everywhere, and even rank seven Gu Immortals lose to him. He lands on a mountain peak in True Yang mountain range and challenges Blazing Demonic Immortal Dan Qiao, offering one thousand five hundred kilograms of hibiscus branches as the wager. After they fight, three lightning figures fly out of his immortal aperture. When Dan Qiao turns into a giant blazing demon, he detonates a lightning deity. Both end the clash heavily injured.",
      "chapters": [
        847
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "challenge-at-true-yang",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "loc_true_yang_mountain_range",
        "char_blazing_demonic_immortal_dan_qiao"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Song Zi Xing’s battlefield killer move Blood Tu Su envelops the two wounded immortals. He claims he will not interfere with Song Zi Xing’s revenge and threatens to self-detonate lightning deities to force a way out. Song Zi Xing reads a flaw in that act. He and Dan Qiao then join forces and attack Song Zi Xing together; they were bait in a larger ambush.",
      "chapters": [
        848
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "ambush",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_song_zi_xing",
        "move_blood_tu_su"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Blood Tu Su collapses he is heavily injured and in a coma. Only one weak lightning deity is left, guarding him. A Myriad Dragon Dock Gu Immortal stays behind to take care of him.",
      "chapters": [
        849
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "coma",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Vicious Lightning Fiend’s pace at deducing lightning deity does not reach a tenth of the speed Fang Yuan shows while reworking vajra shell.",
      "chapters": [
        1314
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lightning-deitys-deduction-time",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "He has rank seven cultivation and is a famous expert. He comes in person to ask He Feng Yang about Fang Yuan, and He Feng Yang has to lower his head.",
      "chapters": [
        2276
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "personal-inquiry",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_he_feng_yang"
      ]
    }
  ],
